reation effects after relaxation, incomplete inputs and secret leakage refuse reuse. Pipeline integrates facts/results without duplicating machinery. Additional complete C3 cache result uses actual semantic syntax identities, complete selected serialized subjects and real producer-conditioned invalidation/currentness decisions before a hit or dependent artifact use. Apply stage-specific owner and current-policy revalidation; reject stale syntax, facts, origin diagnostics or proofs rather than trusting timestamps, hashes alone or current flags. Preserve permitted engine-specific machinery under shared Build policy. No repeated external action authorizes a cache hit, and source-only cache subjects do not require later semantic products they do not contain.",
