ty outcome or admitted Core/MIR. Missing review can reject, and audit-only records without an approval gate. Imported certificate/unsafe summaries refer to already-built dependency packages Q; current package P emits its own local safety products before its later packaging. P's own published certificate is never its classification input. Additional SAFE2-SAFE5 classification consumes complete specialized access/initialization/alias/lifetime/region/generation/linear/transfer facts and obligations, exact current profile/provider availability and existing subject-bound proof/audit decisions. Bind each permitted dynamic check to the operation, attached state, emitted identity/location, declared failure and introduced effects before violation; actual check/failure execution remains later evidence. Missing dynamic machinery requires the specific source rule's proof or refusal, with an explicit audited unsafe alternative only where that rule and profile/mode policy permit it. SAFE3 normal-borrow and SAFE4 safe arena-use refusals survive. Unsafe candidates and supplied verdicts confer neither a fifth outcome nor accepted MIR; existing required specialist review remains separate from audit-only records. Additional L10/L18 disposition covers the exact source/provider replacement, raw/MMIO/foreign wrapper and privileged-forget obligations. Preserve the actual type/ownership/effect/grant, map/width/volatile/order/lifetime, failure/cleanup and source-bound proof/audit inputs; provider trust, a wrapper label or another subject's certificate cannot admit the operation. Candidate, policy-required specialist and final four-outcome stages remain distinct; audit-only gains no approval gate. Additional SAFE8 classification combines actual race/capture/share/guard/message facts with checked effects, provider contracts, typed schemas and profile/grant premises. Choose only proven-safe, valid preventive runtime synchronization, rejected or explicit audited unsafe-island; a debug detector after a race cannot replace compile-time evidence. Enforce detached-capture, consumed-parent move, immutable representation, exact guard release, channel-close/backpressure and actor-state rules. Current checked Core is the later consumer of these decisions, not their missing initial fact source. Preserve audit-only review metadata versus separately supplied policy-required review and every actual unsafe/FFI restriction. Additional full provider legality consumes actual typed capability/action and eight-layer grant decisions, compatible provider/profile/target contracts, imported Q trust verification and explicit available isolation/check machinery. Candidate Core and solved facts precede classification; checked Core follows the real decision. Trust, declaration, runtime deployment permission and a supplied safe flag cannot legalize statically rejected effects or ambient authority. Preserve all four safety outcomes and conditional unsafe review without inventing a fifth pending-safe result. Additional L12 safety composition consumes real candidate P or generated Q operations, actual type/effect/grant/profile/capture/allocation and provider/check contracts before its four-outcome decision. Early candidates are not final Expand5 conformance; final Q admission consumes this decision later. Runtime fallback must be explicitly allowed and legal, not an escape from phase/representation/unsafe failures. Preserve source-bound proof/check/unsafe obligations and actual review/isolation where required, without fuel or a fifth pending-safe outcome. Additional joint macro safety consumes actual expanded operations and declaration/observed-behavior, capture/authority/phase, full SAFE6, taint/sink and source-origin products before the ordinary four-outcome decision. Expand retains macro analysis and Legality retains ordinary Q classification. A passed declaration or typed engine cannot waive checks or supply missing review; reject illegal generated unsafe/profile/authority/provenance behavior with actual definition/call/generated context. Additional complete C3 safety boundary consumes actual verified syntax/origin/hygiene/phase records and applicable fresh semantic facts, preserving proof obligations as obligations. Legality computes the governing four outcomes; Syntax does not create a proof or unsafe authorization. Reject stale or fabricated safety facts and keep actual proof/certificate requirements at their claimed boundary, without mandatory replacement proof admission for ordinary syntax. Complete L2/C6 safety admission classifies actual dangerous operations against current type/effect/ownership/profile and applicable proof/check/audit facts. Preserve proven-safe, runtime-checked, rejected or explicit unsafe-island outcomes without backend undefined behavior or an implicit fifth result. Core expression/control/effect/panic/refusal behavior is not this safety classification. Required runtime checks and failure semantics survive into actual later MIR/lowering/execution products.",
