 complete L3/C5 type handoff uses actual resolved/verified bindings, selected legal imports/graph and current namespace definition/type records. Retain real solved type/protocol/call identities and separate inferred versus declared facts before Effects/Legality/MIR. Reject stale exports, substituted bindings and inconsistent module/checker facts; an early namespace map is not final type or authority acceptance. Complete L2/C6 typed handoff attaches actual current solutions, function latent/error/capability contracts, call/dispatch/capture and explicit dynamic/layout/schema records to verified candidate Core before Effects/Legality. This early typed product is not final profile/safety acceptance or the same subject's future checked Core. Reject missing, stale or inconsistent node facts, retaining source/generated and primitive diagnostic context. Complete L5/C7 typed verification checks the actual entire current subject: exactly one type or diagnostic per node, every constraint solved or rejected, full function latent/thrown/capability/ownership/profile records, all nontrivial cast records, profile-marked dynamic boundaries, authentic source schema links, required actual layouts and preserved origins. Verify full artifact round-trip and reject missing, stale or coherently substituted nodes, solutions, callers, transfer/layout/schema dependencies and diagnostics. Available ABI/schema/checker contracts precede their actual selected products; early typed expressions may feed layout/query derivation before final typed verification. Verification precedes Effects claiming legality; actual Effects/Auth/profile/ownership/safety acceptance follows the early typed handoff and precedes checked Core/MIR. A supplied type map, assigned solved/passed status, nonempty table or quoted verification contract proves none of these operations. Complete L7 typed verification checks actual narrowed branch environments, scrutinee/pattern compatibility, guard normal Bool or non-returning transfer, coverage/domain and authentic validation links with current source references. This typed gate precedes Effects claiming legality; later actual effect/profile/ownership decisions and final checked-tree composition remain distinct. Verify/read back actual complete attached facts and reject missing, stale or coherently substituted products; no field-presence or expected-result table is a semantic verdict. Complete L8 typed verification first validates actual independent type contracts and tentative dispatch inputs for effect analysis. Later full checked-dispatch composition validates actual method compatibility, visible effects, separate grants and profile/host/schema facts after owner results arrive. Do not require final effect admission to construct its own preliminary typed call graph, or accept a complete container as nine-field compatibility and seven diagnostic detection.",
