fe input/output records are required; assigned determinism/equivalence statuses are not evidence. Preserve marked native metadata exceptions and separate archive/signing/publication authority. Additional complete C3 reproducibility comparison consumes actual complete serialized source/generated subjects and applicable fact invalidation/revalidation results. Compare stable semantic syntax identity/context under the selected representation, separately from same-input hermetic typed-Core byte equality and independently admitted stage/seed results. A round-trip flag, summary payload or one encoding cannot establish any broader comparison. Additional complete L3/C5 rebuild comparison uses actual reproducible module/index/solution products and applicable invalidation. Test documentation/format changes for stable semantic binding ids with updated exact provenance, separately from same-input hermetic typed-Core byte equality, stage equivalence and seed retirement. Changed source bytes are changed build inputs, not a normalization waiver. Reject unexplained identity or consumer drift under the governing package policy.",
