nce behavior with actual definition/call/generated context. Additional complete C3 safety boundary consumes actual verified syntax/origin/hygiene/phase records and applicable fresh semantic facts, preserving proof obligations as obligations. Legality computes the governing four outcomes; Syntax does not create a proof or unsafe authorization. Reject stale or fabricated safety facts and keep actual proof/certificate requirements at their claimed boundary, without mandatory replacement proof admission for ordinary syntax.",
