hese cases. Owner results are not independent Release suite runs, broad target availability or current independent acceptance; held cases remain unassessed. Additional complete L3/C5 legality conformance produces its own actual accepted/refused namespace/profile/graph/checker fixtures and consumer-preservation products from the selected resolver outputs. Cover missing/multiple profiles, the explicit seed exception, library exclusions, all five cross-profile boundaries, unavailable effects/grants and illegal initialization. These owner cases precede the independent language/compiler/profile harnesses that consume them; completion of those later full suites cannot be the owner fixtures' first construction input. Preserve the exact candidate, source/diagnostic and existing independent acceptance scope without promoting the narrow historical SH06 receipt.",
